              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "o destinatário — \"the addressee, the recipient\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A carta voltou porque o destinatário mudou de casa. The letter came back because the addressee had moved."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "O destino is where it goes; o destinatário is who gets it."
            }
          ]
        },
